Line Follower AI: licenses
==========================

This project has two licenses, depending on the kind of file. Both allow
free use for learning, teaching and other non-commercial purposes, and
neither allows using the project to make money.

1. CODE: the Python files (*.py) and requirements.txt
   PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0. Full text: LICENSE-CODE
   https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0
   (Schools, educational institutions, charities and individuals learning or
   teaching are all permitted uses.)

2. DOCUMENTS AND IMAGES: the guides, glossary, explainers, README, and the
   screenshot in images/
   Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0).
   Full text: LICENSE-DOCS
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/
   You must give credit, link the license, and note any changes you made.

